WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.180
Data is at the center of nearly every product you own,

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.060
your phone, your TV, even your car.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:10.275
Products have become increasingly customized to your needs with the help of data,

00:00:10.275 --> 00:00:12.495
allowing companies like Netflix, Uber,

00:00:12.495 --> 00:00:15.315
and Amazon to build great data-driven products.

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:17.805
Since every product is data-driven,

00:00:17.805 --> 00:00:22.405
the melding of data science and product management is the future or product development.

00:00:22.405 --> 00:00:25.530
Data product managers understand that building

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:29.025
products that incorporate data requires a data strategy,

00:00:29.025 --> 00:00:32.415
a plan for how data will be collected, transform,

00:00:32.415 --> 00:00:37.320
and analyze, [inaudible] position your product to win in the market.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:40.885
In Udacity's Data Product Manager Nanodegree program,

00:00:40.885 --> 00:00:43.940
you'll learn how to build data-driven products backed by

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:46.100
scalable data strategies to deliver

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:49.420
the right experiences to the right users at the right time.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:51.310
In this Nanodegree program,

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:53.870
you'll evaluate market data and create

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:58.445
visualizations to determine the key matrices and features for a new product.

00:00:58.445 --> 00:01:03.005
You will integrate this data backed evidence into a product proposal

00:01:03.005 --> 00:01:07.670
that is supported by a scalable data pipeline and warehousing strategy.

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:11.585
Once you finish, you'll be able to create a data product concept,

00:01:11.585 --> 00:01:16.760
strategize a data pipeline and storage infrastructure to support scaling of the product,

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.820
and enhance the product design based on user data,

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:24.430
leverage data to build products that position customers and businesses to thrive.

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:29.290
Enroll in Udacity's Data Product Manager Nanodegree program today.

